{
  "id": 937,
  "description": "## ✨ Welcome to Lacuna ✨\n\nWe&#039;re not just a guild, we&#039;re a team looking for people who want to be part of building something great together. We&#039;re focused on collaboration and teamwork, with members contributing to shared goals and making decisions as a group. Your voice matters here! 🗣️\n\n### 💬 What We&#039;re About\n\nWe play together, help each other, and grow as a team! We welcome contributors from all countries and nationalities. Feel free to ask questions, join raids, and enjoy the game with everyone! 🌍\n\n- Idle is a lifestyle 🌴\n- Discord is our primary method of communication, as a collaborative guild, we have polls and discussions to make decisions together. You must be part of the discord server to get announcements and guild info!\n- Come fight alongside us! ⚔️\n\n\n### 📅 Pool Hours (Mon-Fri)\n\n##### The main Lacuna guild is focused on assaults (collaboration with guild-mates) and character progression (individual growth). \nAt the time listed below, we activate an Energizing Pool - rewarding our teams collective efforts (based on Guild Mastery) with some buffs! Energizing pools last for 3 hours.\n\n-  Starting Time: ⌚ 7:00 AM PST | 10:00 AM EST ⌚\n\n##### What about Raids?\nOur main team doesn&#039;t raid normally, but during events, often times we run 3 raids per day for those who want some tokens!\n\n### ⚔️ Assaults (Saturday)\n\nDuring our normal event time of ⌚ 7:00 AM PST | 10:00 AM EST ⌚we have a scheduled assault. Assaults are predetermined weekly for us to compete for seasonal buffs.\n\n### ⭐️Benefits\n- A community of helpful and fun people to chat and work towards common guild goals.\n- A Growth Guild System to learn and start from level 1 to eventually becoming powerful!\n- Teleportation to our guildhall location (discounted teleports).\n- Energizing Pool! Regular use of a buff!\n- Active participation in Conquests!\n\n### ✔️ Requirements\n\n- Combat Level: +92 💪\n- Daily Activity: Idle ≠ AFK. Help with daily challenges! Chat and hang out in Discord to make new friends. If you&#039;re inactive without telling anyone for over a week, you may be kicked.\n\n### 🏘️ Lacuna Community \n- Are you a lower combat level but still want to be part of this awesome crew? Come chat on our discord!\n     - Lacuna - CL92+ : https://web.idle-mmo.com/guilds?guild_id=937\n     - Lacunae Echo - CL80+ : https://web.idle-mmo.com/guilds?guild_id=1115\n     - Tiny Lacunas - CL60+ : https://web.idle-mmo.com/guilds?guild_id=1442\n     - Lacuna Academy - CL40+ : https://web.idle-mmo.com/guilds?guild_id=1536\n     - Lacuna Resort - Retired/Snoozers : https://web.idle-mmo.com/guilds?guild_id=1516\n\n🏰 Ready to join a community where your contributions make a real difference? All are welcome on our Discord to come say hi! 👇\n\n##### https://discord.gg/DQvSQNkPbp",
